# Parquet in these dataset releases is stored with Git LFS. The pipeline's
# own exact file allowlist and publication manifest narrow this scope further.
!data_pipeline/input/moocubex_model/**/*.parquet
!data_pipeline/final_quality_v4/**/*.parquet
!data_pipeline/phase_features_v4/**/*.parquet
!data_pipeline/phase_features_v4_2/**/*.parquet
